  "translation": "Gomme ngwageng wa bobedi go ya ga bona go ntlong ya Elohim, go Yerushalayime, kgwedeng ya bobedi, Zerubbabele morwa wa Shealtiele le Yeshua morwa wa Yotsadake, le mafelelo a banaši ba bona, baperisita le Balefi, le bohle bao ba tšwago go tšwa botshwarwing go ya Yerushalayime, ba thoma go laola mošomo; gomme ba emiša ⟨את⟩ Balefi go tloga go morwa wa mengwaga ye masomepedi le godimo, go etapelela mošomong wa ntlo ya Yahwe.",
